NimbyAdmin (Central Scrutinizer, client half) - original work by Jeff Fabish for
NIMBY | HARDCORE | BADLANDS | 1pp. Written from scratch against vanilla DayZ 1.30; no code
from Community Framework, Community Online Tools, or VPP Admin Tools (plan, "What this is
not"). Will modify the vanilla MissionBase, MissionGameplay, and PlayerBase classes (Bohemia
Interactive) for the self-test hook, the menu, and the RPC plumbing. No media.

